# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development. Safe to commit — placeholders only.
#
# The portal reads NONE of these in the default dev setup: `npx vite` runs on
# Miniflare's local D1 + R2 bindings with zero configuration. Everything below
# exists for running the portal against the PRODUCTION-SHAPED stack (Node +
# Postgres + S3 storage), which is what Vercel + Supabase runs. The full map,
# including which Vercel environment each belongs in, is in
# docs/DEPLOYMENT-PORTAL.md.

# ── Database (Supabase Postgres) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# PG_D1=1 switches the D1 shim to Postgres; without it the shim uses SQLite.
# DATABASE_URL: Production uses the TRANSACTION pooler (port 6543); the adapter
# turns prepared statements off there automatically. (This comment used to say
# 6543 deadlocks this workload — that was measured on the Phase 2 API, not the
# portal; see docs/DEPLOYMENT-PORTAL.md.) db/node-pg-d1.ts still logs a warning
# on 6543 until its next change; the warning is out of date, not a fault.
# PG_D1=1
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres"

# ── Storage (Supabase Storage over its S3-compatible API) ────────────────────
# All four or none — a partial set falls back to the local-filesystem driver,
# which on Vercel means uploads land in per-instance /tmp and vanish.
# S3_ENDPOINT="https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/storage/v1/s3"
# S3_BUCKET="maintsupp-files"
# S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID="<storage-access-key>"
# S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY="<storage-secret-key>"
# S3_REGION="eu-west-2"

# ── Auth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The owner account's seed password (min 12 chars). In production this is
# REQUIRED: with no value the owner row is created with no password and
# sign-in fails closed. In development the documented public default applies.
# MAINTSUPP_OWNER_PASSWORD="<a-long-owner-password>"

# ── Node-runtime local alternatives (Railway-style, not needed for Vite dev) ─
# D1_SQLITE_PATH="./.storage/portal.sqlite"
# R2_LOCAL_DIR="./.storage/r2"
